WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.195
The habit to keep.

2
00:00:01.475 --> 00:00:03.885
Every prompt change is a hypothesis.

3
00:00:04.165 --> 00:00:11.035
The test set is how you check it, the per-case fixes and regressions are the evidence, and the change log is the record.

4
00:00:11.315 --> 00:00:18.568
Keep untrusted text separate from instructions, validate what comes back, and never let raw model output act on its own.

5
00:00:18.848 --> 00:00:26.485
That is the checks-and-balances discipline the rest of this program builds on, whichever model or provider you end up using.
